{"seq":2,"slug":"chemical-leavening","title":"化学膨胀剂原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/leavening-fermentation/chemical-leavening","wordCount":2195,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"化学膨胀剂原理\">化学膨胀剂原理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>化学膨胀剂（chemical leavening agents）通过酸碱中和反应生成二氧化碳气体，无需发酵等待即可使面糊或面团膨胀。与酵母发酵的缓慢持续产气不同，化学膨胀的特征是反应速率可通过组分设计精确调控——从搅拌时即刻释放到烤箱中受热才释放，工程师可以&quot;编程&quot;气体在何时何地产生。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[化学膨胀] --&gt; B[碱性组分]&#10;    A --&gt; C[酸性组分]&#10;    A --&gt; D[填充剂]&#10;    B --&gt; E[小苏打 NaHCO3]&#10;    C --&gt; F[快速反应酸]&#10;    C --&gt; G[慢速反应酸]&#10;    F --&gt; H[酒石酸氢钾 室温反应]&#10;    F --&gt; I[磷酸二氢钙 MCP 室温反应]&#10;    G --&gt; J[焦磷酸二氢钠 SAPP 受热反应]&#10;    G --&gt; K[硫酸铝钠 SAS 受热反应]&#10;    D --&gt; L[淀粉 防潮隔离]\">flowchart TD\n    A[化学膨胀] --&gt; B[碱性组分]\n    A --&gt; C[酸性组分]\n    A --&gt; D[填充剂]\n    B --&gt; E[小苏打 NaHCO3]\n    C --&gt; F[快速反应酸]\n    C --&gt; G[慢速反应酸]\n    F --&gt; H[酒石酸氢钾 室温反应]\n    F --&gt; I[磷酸二氢钙 MCP 室温反应]\n    G --&gt; J[焦磷酸二氢钠 SAPP 受热反应]\n    G --&gt; K[硫酸铝钠 SAS 受热反应]\n    D --&gt; L[淀粉 防潮隔离]</pre><p>化学膨胀的核心反应：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>NaHCO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext>H</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mtext>Na</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>↑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NaHCO}_3 + \\text{H}^+ \\rightarrow \\text{Na}^+ + \\text{H}_2\\text{O} + \\text{CO}_2\\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NaHCO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9279em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Na</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每摩尔小苏打（84g）理论产生 1 mol <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（22.4 L 在 STP 下）。这比酵母发酵的产气效率高出数个数量级——少量化学膨胀剂即可产生大量气体，但缺乏发酵带来的风味。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>膨胀方式</th>\n<th>产气速率</th>\n<th>风味贡献</th>\n<th>适用产品</th>\n<th>配方约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>酵母发酵</td>\n<td>慢（1-12h）</td>\n<td>极丰富</td>\n<td>面包、丹麦</td>\n<td>需要面筋网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泡打粉</td>\n<td>快（分钟级）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>蛋糕、松饼</td>\n<td>低筋或无筋</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小苏打+酸</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>中性化</td>\n<td>巧克力蛋糕、爱尔兰苏打面包</td>\n<td>需要酸性配料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理膨胀</td>\n<td>受热时</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>泡芙、千层</td>\n<td>需要高温蒸汽</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"碳酸氢钠-小苏打-的化学\">碳酸氢钠（小苏打）的化学</h2><p>碳酸氢钠（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>NaHCO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NaHCO}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NaHCO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，baking soda）是所有化学膨胀体系的碱性基础。其反应化学决定了使用规则：</p>\n<p><strong>与酸反应</strong>（主要膨胀机制）： </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>NaHCO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>HA</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>NaA</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>↑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{NaHCO}_3 + \\text{HA} \\rightarrow \\text{NaA} + \\text{H}_2\\text{O} + \\text{CO}_2\\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NaHCO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NaA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 HA 代表任何酸性物质——可以是配方中的酸性配料（酪乳、柠檬汁、蜂蜜、可可粉、红糖中的糖蜜）或特意添加的化学酸盐。</p>\n<p><strong>热分解</strong>（次要机制，需 &gt;80°C）： </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mtext>NaHCO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mpadded></mover><msub><mtext>Na</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>↑</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{NaHCO}_3 \\xrightarrow{\\Delta} \\text{Na}_2\\text{CO}_3 + \\text{H}_2\\text{O} + \\text{CO}_2\\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2503em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NaHCO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Na</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>热分解产物碳酸钠（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Na</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Na}_2\\text{CO}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Na</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）呈强碱性（pH &gt; 11），会导致产品发黄（碱性环境下类黄酮色素变色）和产生肥皂味。这就是为什么小苏打用量必须与酸配料精确平衡——过量小苏打 = 碱性残留 = 不良风味和色泽。</p>\n<p><strong>小苏打用量计算原则</strong>：中和值（Neutralization Value, NV）定义为完全中和 100 份小苏打所需的酸盐份数。配方中：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>小苏打用量</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>酸盐用量</mtext><mrow><mtext>NV</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>100</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{小苏打用量} = \\frac{\\text{酸盐用量}}{\\text{NV}/100}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">小苏打用量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NV</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/100</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">酸盐用量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>酸性配料</th>\n<th>pH 范围</th>\n<th>与小苏打的反应速度</th>\n<th>配方中的功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>酪乳</td>\n<td>4.4-4.8</td>\n<td>室温即反应</td>\n<td>提供酸度 + 湿润度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>天然可可粉</td>\n<td>5.0-6.0</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>巧克力风味 + 酸源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蜂蜜</td>\n<td>3.2-4.5</td>\n<td>室温即反应</td>\n<td>甜味 + 酸度 + 保湿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红糖/糖蜜</td>\n<td>5.0-5.5</td>\n<td>缓慢</td>\n<td>风味 + 轻度酸源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>柠檬汁/醋</td>\n<td>2.0-3.0</td>\n<td>极快（瞬间）</td>\n<td>专用酸源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酸奶</td>\n<td>4.0-4.5</td>\n<td>室温反应</td>\n<td>质地 + 酸源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"泡打粉的工程设计\">泡打粉的工程设计</h2><p>泡打粉（baking powder）是将小苏打、酸性盐和填充剂预混合的便利产品，解决了小苏打需要配方含酸的限制。现代泡打粉几乎都是&quot;双效&quot;（double-acting）设计——两种酸盐的组合实现分阶段释气：</p>\n<p><strong>第一阶段（bench reaction）</strong>：快速酸盐在室温接触水分时即刻反应，在搅拌阶段产生 20-30% 的总气体。这些初始气泡作为&quot;种子核&quot;（seed nuclei），确保后续热释放的气体有现成的泡核可膨胀而非需要突破表面张力新成核。</p>\n<p><strong>第二阶段（oven reaction）</strong>：慢速酸盐在 60-80°C 才溶解或活化，在烤箱中释放 70-80% 的总气体。此时面糊已经开始凝固（蛋白质变性、淀粉糊化），气泡被固定在部分凝固的基质中。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 双效泡打粉&#10;        A[快速酸 MCP] --&gt;|室温 30%| B[初始气核]&#10;        C[慢速酸 SAPP/SAS] --&gt;|60-80°C 70%| D[热释放膨胀]&#10;    end&#10;    B --&gt; E[面糊中种子气泡]&#10;    D --&gt; F[烤箱中体积增大]&#10;    E --&gt; G[最终产品蓬松]&#10;    F --&gt; G\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 双效泡打粉\n        A[快速酸 MCP] --&gt;|室温 30%| B[初始气核]\n        C[慢速酸 SAPP/SAS] --&gt;|60-80°C 70%| D[热释放膨胀]\n    end\n    B --&gt; E[面糊中种子气泡]\n    D --&gt; F[烤箱中体积增大]\n    E --&gt; G[最终产品蓬松]\n    F --&gt; G</pre><p>主要化学酸盐的特性对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>酸盐</th>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>NV</th>\n<th>反应条件</th>\n<th>速率分类</th>\n<th>风味影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>磷酸二氢钙单水合物</td>\n<td>MCP</td>\n<td>80</td>\n<td>室温+水</td>\n<td>快速</td>\n<td>中性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无水磷酸二氢钙</td>\n<td>AMCP</td>\n<td>83</td>\n<td>需加热</td>\n<td>慢速</td>\n<td>中性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>焦磷酸二氢钠</td>\n<td>SAPP</td>\n<td>72</td>\n<td>60°C+</td>\n<td>慢速</td>\n<td>微苦（过量时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硫酸铝钠</td>\n<td>SAS</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>60°C+</td>\n<td>慢速</td>\n<td>金属味（过量时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酒石酸氢钾</td>\n<td>Cream of Tartar</td>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>室温+水</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>中性偏酸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>葡萄糖酸-δ-内酯</td>\n<td>GDL</td>\n<td>45</td>\n<td>水解后缓慢</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>温和酸味</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>标准双效泡打粉配方示例：28% NaHCO₃ + 12% MCP + 26% SAPP + 34% 玉米淀粉。淀粉作为填充剂隔离酸碱组分防止储存期间反应，同时提供便于称量的总量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"释气率与产品结构的关系\">释气率与产品结构的关系</h2><p>化学膨胀的工程核心在于&quot;释气率&quot;（Dough Rate of Reaction, DRR）——即在特定温度和时间条件下已释放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 占总可释放量的百分比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>SAPP 品种</th>\n<th>DRR（40°C, 8min）</th>\n<th>适用产品</th>\n<th>设计意图</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SAPP 28</td>\n<td>28%</td>\n<td>冷冻面团</td>\n<td>极慢释放，防止冻融气泡合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SAPP 40</td>\n<td>40%</td>\n<td>标准蛋糕</td>\n<td>平衡bench/oven释放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SAPP 43</td>\n<td>43%</td>\n<td>松饼/玛芬</td>\n<td>偏快释放，快速定型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DRR 的选择直接影响产品气孔结构：</p>\n<p>DRR 过快 → 气体在面糊凝固前过度膨胀 → 气泡合并形成大孔洞 → 产品粗糙不均匀、可能塌陷</p>\n<p>DRR 过慢 → 面糊在气体充分释放前已凝固 → 体积不足 → 产品致密沉重</p>\n<p>最佳 DRR 设计使主要产气恰好发生在面糊从液态向半固态转变的窗口期（setting point）——气泡被部分凝固的基质包裹固定，形成均匀细密的气孔结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"酸碱平衡与风味调控\">酸碱平衡与风味调控</h2><p>化学膨胀体系的酸碱平衡不仅影响产气量，还直接决定产品的 pH 值、色泽和风味：</p>\n<p><strong>pH 对色泽的影响</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>碱性（pH &gt; 7.5）：美拉德反应加速 → 产品深色、可可粉变红（荷兰工艺巧克力）</li>\n<li>中性（pH 6.5-7.5）：标准着色</li>\n<li>酸性（pH &lt; 6.5）：美拉德反应减速 → 产品浅色</li>\n</ul>\n<p>经典应用案例——魔鬼蛋糕（Devil&#39;s Food Cake）：大量小苏打使面糊呈碱性（pH ~8），可可粉中的花青素在碱性环境下呈现深红棕色，同时美拉德反应增强产生更深的巧克力色和更浓郁的烤香。</p>\n<p><strong>残余碱度</strong>：当小苏打过量（酸不足以完全中和）时，产品中残留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Na</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>CO</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Na}_2\\text{CO}_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Na</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 导致：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>碱性肥皂味（感官阈值约 pH 7.5）</li>\n<li>黄色色调（面粉黄酮在碱性下显色）</li>\n<li>质地过度松散（面筋在碱性下弱化）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>配方设计规则：小苏打用量应使最终产品 pH 在 7.0-7.5 范围。需要深色和强烈风味时可适度偏碱（7.5-8.0）；需要清淡纯净风味时偏酸（6.5-7.0）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"物理膨胀机制\">物理膨胀机制</h2><p>除化学产气外，两种纯物理机制在特定产品中是主要膨胀来源：</p>\n<p><strong>蒸汽膨胀</strong>：水在 100°C 时从液态转为气态，体积膨胀约 1600 倍。在高温烤箱中，面团/面糊中的水分快速汽化产生强大的膨胀力。千层酥（puff pastry）完全依赖蒸汽膨胀——油脂层隔开的面皮层在蒸汽推动下分层膨起。泡芙（choux pastry）同样以蒸汽为主要膨胀力——高含水面糊在 200°C+ 烤箱中快速产生蒸汽。</p>\n<p><strong>空气包裹</strong>：搅拌过程中机械力将空气包裹入面糊形成微小气泡核。戚风蛋糕和海绵蛋糕中，打发蛋白提供的空气气泡是主要膨胀基础——后续烘焙中热膨胀和蒸汽使这些预存气泡进一步膨大。严格来说空气不&quot;产生&quot;新气体，而是使已有气泡在热条件下扩张。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>物理膨胀方式</th>\n<th>膨胀力来源</th>\n<th>代表产品</th>\n<th>关键技术要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>蒸汽</td>\n<td>水→气体积×1600</td>\n<td>千层酥、泡芙、约克郡布丁</td>\n<td>高温烤箱、高含水</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空气（蛋白打发）</td>\n<td>热膨胀</td>\n<td>天使蛋糕、舒芙蕾</td>\n<td>稳定蛋白泡沫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空气（全蛋打发）</td>\n<td>热膨胀</td>\n<td>海绵蛋糕、戚风</td>\n<td>糖稳定泡沫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空气（油脂搅打）</td>\n<td>热膨胀</td>\n<td>磅蛋糕、奶油蛋糕</td>\n<td>油脂裹气（creaming）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>化学膨胀是烘焙工程中精确可控的产气体系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>小苏打是唯一碱源，必须与酸精确平衡——过量产生碱味和黄色</li>\n<li>泡打粉的双效设计通过快/慢酸盐组合实现分阶段释气</li>\n<li>DRR 是连接配方设计与产品气孔结构的关键工程参数</li>\n<li>酸碱平衡同时调控产气量、pH 值、色泽和风味</li>\n<li>蒸汽和空气膨胀在无需化学反应的场景下提供物理膨胀力</li>\n<li>化学膨胀与物理膨胀常协同工作——蛋糕中泡打粉 + 蛋白打发的组合最为典型</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"化学膨胀剂原理","id":"化学膨胀剂原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"碳酸氢钠（小苏打）的化学","id":"碳酸氢钠-小苏打-的化学"},{"level":2,"text":"泡打粉的工程设计","id":"泡打粉的工程设计"},{"level":2,"text":"释气率与产品结构的关系","id":"释气率与产品结构的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"酸碱平衡与风味调控","id":"酸碱平衡与风味调控"},{"level":2,"text":"物理膨胀机制","id":"物理膨胀机制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"酵母发酵的生物化学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/leavening-fermentation/yeast-biochemistry"},"next":{"title":"发酵工艺与面包风味","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/baking-science/leavening-fermentation/fermentation-process"}}